WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:13.619
Fighting pollution is just one of the many
items on the agenda at the climate change

00:00:13.619 --> 00:00:15.830
conference in Katowice.

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:20.300
But for many countries the price of confronting
global warming is steep.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:24.770
Just the fact that Poland is hosting this
gathering has been slammed by environmental

00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:27.759
groups - because of its dependence on coal.

00:00:27.759 --> 00:00:38.730
The Polish president dismissed the critics."Using
one's own natural resources, in Poland's case

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:47.170
coal, and basing energy security on them does
not conflict with climate protection and with

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:51.110
progress on climate change.

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:52.800
The UN begs to differ.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:56.819
It says greenhouse gas levels are again at
a record high worldwide.

00:00:56.819 --> 00:01:03.589
If that trend continues, temperatures could
rise by 3 to 5 degrees Celsius this century.

00:01:03.589 --> 00:01:12.000
Extreme weather ranging from hurricanes to
droughts, flooding and wild fires would become

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.210
the norm, not an exception.

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:21.820
Even as we witness devastating climate impacts
causing havoc across the world, we are still

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:30.720
not doing enough, nor moving fast enough,
to prevent irreversible and catastrophic climate

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:32.310
disruption."

00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:36.590
The US has said it is planning to withdraw
from the Paris climate accord.

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:40.610
But many American states and cities are deeply
committed to the pact.

00:01:40.610 --> 00:01:45.460
They even brought their big guns to Poland
like former California governor Arnold Schwarzenegger

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:53.010
to try and show - they'd like to be back
I wish I could be the terminator - in real

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:53.730
life.

